<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said analyst Jason Mollin upgraded Banco de Galicia y Buenos Aires SA to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited better-than-expected fiscal 1997 results.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1998 earnings per ADR estimate to $1.81 from $1.74.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 41/64 to 30-9/16.</p>
</text>
